      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-001-018.mp3",
      "subtitle": "咳咳。\n……从遥远的远古时代起，与我共同奋战的魔导士啊……"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "今夜，从解开火与黑暗之封印的黑暗之地，\n速速出现在我面前吧……！",
      "cue": "band5-001-019",
      "storyId": "81",
      "scenario": "band5-001",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-001.asset",
