      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory81_rip/band5-001-022.mp3",
      "sha256": "a3295e676de92dea8992ea27fd18b803cea22e6faee9091558583cbb62e0099b",
      "nativeSha256": "a3295e676de92dea8992ea27fd18b803cea22e6faee9091558583cbb62e0099b",
      "bytes": 45360,
      "seconds": 4.636,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-001-022.mp3",
      "subtitle": "欸嘿嘿。谢谢夸奖。那就走吧！\n……哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "……喂。燐燐，那、那个人拿着的是……\n吉他盒吧？\n她在玩乐队吧？真好啊，亚子也想组乐队……！",
      "cue": "band5-001-026",
      "storyId": "81",
      "scenario": "band5-001",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-001.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-001.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory81_rip/band5-001-026.mp3",
      "sha256": "d49062a1cb06786551471827df771e6eba5ce5699913a563a7aa581a9f3be01c",
      "nativeSha256": "d49062a1cb06786551471827df771e6eba5ce5699913a563a7aa581a9f3be01c",
      "bytes": 118800,
      "seconds": 12.474,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-001-026.mp3",
      "subtitle": "……喂。燐燐，那、那个人拿着的是……\n吉他盒吧？\n她在玩乐队吧？真好啊，亚子也想组乐队……！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "燐燐，该走了！\n今天我有点想严格按照日程表来呢",
      "cue": "band5-001-028",
      "storyId": "81",
      "scenario": "band5-001",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-001.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-001.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory81_rip/band5-001-028.mp3",
      "sha256": "1b7e8b53ec1a69843ed837a10e4782c5a4eb936322d965bcc0bdb00174f38c41",
      "nativeSha256": "1b7e8b53ec1a69843ed837a10e4782c5a4eb936322d965bcc0bdb00174f38c41",
      "bytes": 63180,
      "seconds": 5.787,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-001-028.mp3",
      "subtitle": "燐燐，该走了！\n今天我有点想严格按照日程表来呢"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "然后，我想好了舞蹈编排去参加了社团活动，\n有个叫莉莎姐的学姐，说我表现得不错呢！\n……喂，你在听吗？燐燐？",
      "cue": "band5-002-028",
      "storyId": "82",
      "scenario": "band5-002",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-002.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-002.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory82_rip/band5-002-028.mp3",
      "sha256": "49fa54c660fd7f74f817b679af35ede8b2aff682cc70c78affbe734e36fc2964",
      "nativeSha256": "49fa54c660fd7f74f817b679af35ede8b2aff682cc70c78affbe734e36fc2964",
      "bytes": 111564,
      "seconds": 10.398,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-002-028.mp3",
      "subtitle": "然后，我想好了舞蹈编排去参加了社团活动，\n有个叫莉莎姐的学姐，说我表现得不错呢！\n……喂，你在听吗？燐燐？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "嘿嘿。你注意到了呢，燐燐。和我想的一样。\n那问题来了！\n这家咖啡厅隔壁到底是什么？",
      "cue": "band5-002-030",
      "storyId": "82",
      "scenario": "band5-002",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-002.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-002.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory82_rip/band5-002-030.mp3",
      "sha256": "c0cc8ee9892236cb7fde441c76d0531595c3209a69dbde7dd8e75f43c3a003f5",
      "nativeSha256": "c0cc8ee9892236cb7fde441c76d0531595c3209a69dbde7dd8e75f43c3a003f5",
      "bytes": 100404,
      "seconds": 8.9,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-002-030.mp3",
      "subtitle": "嘿嘿。你注意到了呢，燐燐。和我想的一样。\n那问题来了！\n这家咖啡厅隔壁到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "燐燐。你知道LIVEHOUSE吗？",
      "cue": "band5-002-032",
      "storyId": "82",
      "scenario": "band5-002",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-002.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-002.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory82_rip/band5-002-032.mp3",
      "sha256": "27d272ab38173b7156b52b11271340265feb194f8b3d28635fddafe058920e69",
      "nativeSha256": "27d272ab38173b7156b52b11271340265feb194f8b3d28635fddafe058920e69",
      "bytes": 38268,
      "seconds": 3.425,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-002-032.mp3",
      "subtitle": "燐燐。你知道LIVEHOUSE吗？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "对！这个咖啡厅隔壁就是LIVEHOUSE！\n亚子最近很爱去LIVEHOUSE呢",
      "cue": "band5-003-002",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-002.mp3",
      "sha256": "a003c8dfd01b866fd3612ccbfdba74a72660aaf17c799f31caa8c43093cdf3df",
      "nativeSha256": "a003c8dfd01b866fd3612ccbfdba74a72660aaf17c799f31caa8c43093cdf3df",
      "bytes": 77616,
      "seconds": 6.943,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-002.mp3",
      "subtitle": "对！这个咖啡厅隔壁就是LIVEHOUSE！\n亚子最近很爱去LIVEHOUSE呢"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "寻找懂的人才懂，只属于自己的乐队……\n感觉很帅气吧？",
      "cue": "band5-003-003",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-003.mp3",
      "sha256": "40abc5d6aafc9446eb8a980298d01d9734393c865ceec4ae3736a78a0724f62e",
      "nativeSha256": "40abc5d6aafc9446eb8a980298d01d9734393c865ceec4ae3736a78a0724f62e",
      "bytes": 63720,
      "seconds": 5.321,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-003.mp3",
      "subtitle": "寻找懂的人才懂，只属于自己的乐队……\n感觉很帅气吧？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "对吧？\n然后呢，我终于找到了。只属于亚子的超帅气的人！",
      "cue": "band5-003-005",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-005.mp3",
      "sha256": "431b1d139f88ea0169810605bf2881721551a8827c54bfca75ab8614c299c1bd",
      "nativeSha256": "431b1d139f88ea0169810605bf2881721551a8827c54bfca75ab8614c299c1bd",
      "bytes": 72864,
      "seconds": 6.668,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-005.mp3",
      "subtitle": "对吧？\n然后呢，我终于找到了。只属于亚子的超帅气的人！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "谢谢\n燐燐就是我寻找帅气之人的搭档",
      "cue": "band5-003-007",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-007.mp3",
      "sha256": "417a76e8dbf74d898f1da5a1ca0618864a4cb85f574508fa93d2b38958429615",
      "nativeSha256": "417a76e8dbf74d898f1da5a1ca0618864a4cb85f574508fa93d2b38958429615",
      "bytes": 60408,
      "seconds": 4.977,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-007.mp3",
      "subtitle": "谢谢\n燐燐就是我寻找帅气之人的搭档"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "在网游里也一直帮助我，我真的很感谢你。\n之前也帮我过了新任务，\n多亏了你，亚子才做成了新武器……",
      "cue": "band5-003-008",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-008.mp3",
      "sha256": "f83649677b63eb7a08b569a985db7624827ea460bc5b7e9aa833105deed87a87",
      "nativeSha256": "f83649677b63eb7a08b569a985db7624827ea460bc5b7e9aa833105deed87a87",
      "bytes": 128088,
      "seconds": 10.721,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-008.mp3",
      "subtitle": "在网游里也一直帮助我，我真的很感谢你。\n之前也帮我过了新任务，\n多亏了你，亚子才做成了新武器……"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "……先不提这个！所以燐燐，来不来LIVEHOUSE？",
      "cue": "band5-003-009",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-009.mp3",
      "sha256": "6a1cdac16cd5b6f8873004651869d110cb33a1654d33246574976c28d8a1724e",
      "nativeSha256": "6a1cdac16cd5b6f8873004651869d110cb33a1654d33246574976c28d8a1724e",
      "bytes": 52632,
      "seconds": 4.624,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-009.mp3",
      "subtitle": "……先不提这个！所以燐燐，来不来LIVEHOUSE？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "啊，对了对了。虽然人很多，\n但饮品吧台附近很空，没事的！",
      "cue": "band5-003-012",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-012.mp3",
      "sha256": "756c43f1c26db3fd30c7e37c0e7ccd0cbb3d4d8f745a6d0277c42d26688c7736",
      "nativeSha256": "756c43f1c26db3fd30c7e37c0e7ccd0cbb3d4d8f745a6d0277c42d26688c7736",
      "bytes": 73152,
      "seconds": 6.197,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-012.mp3",
      "subtitle": "啊，对了对了。虽然人很多，\n但饮品吧台附近很空，没事的！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "没关系的。因为燐燐很不喜欢吵闹，\n所以今天看完那个人出场就回去！\n……好嘛，求求你了！",
      "cue": "band5-003-014",
      "storyId": "83",
      "scenario": "band5-003",
      "scenarioUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "subtitleUrl": "https://bestdori.com/assets/cn/scenario/band/005_rip/Scenarioband5-003.asset",
      "url": "https://bestdori.com/assets/jp/sound/voice/scenario/bandstory83_rip/band5-003-014.mp3",
      "sha256": "1cd9f12d252bbd5b4b51f82726fc24df6412a0a08471ad5546f1a261b68a0676",
      "nativeSha256": "1cd9f12d252bbd5b4b51f82726fc24df6412a0a08471ad5546f1a261b68a0676",
      "bytes": 99972,
      "seconds": 9.148,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_band5-003-014.mp3",
      "subtitle": "没关系的。因为燐燐很不喜欢吵闹，\n所以今天看完那个人出场就回去！\n……好嘛，求求你了！"
    },
    {
      "slug": "ako",
      "provider": "Bestdori",
      "characterId": 24,
      "speaker": 24,
      "text": "别担心，有亚子在呢。\n而且……亚子也想有一天能够报答\n总是帮助自己的燐燐啊",
